/// The Rainforest House with every snack (100%), human-possible, in 2235 ticks.
/// Every stretch of buttons is held 3 ticks or more, and jump is pressed only after it was let
/// go. Of its 292 changes of buttons, each moved 1 or 2 ticks early or late, 278 live
/// through the second after, 260 through two seconds, and 227 through the whole
